<title>JAPAN: Nippon Avionics - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Avionics - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 16.37		vs	   15.24</p>
<p> Operating   loss 310    million	  vs   loss 162    million</p>
<p> Current     loss 388    million	  vs   loss 330    million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 398    million	  vs   loss 339    million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 14.09 yen	  vs    loss 11.99 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     28 million	  vs	  28 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Nippon Avionics Co Ltd is a major manufacturer of electonic aircraft equipment.</p>
